  "Úsečka $KL$ meria ${@0}\\,\\text{cm}$, úsečka $MN$ meria ${@1}\\,\\text{cm}$. O koľko centimetrov je úsečka $KL$ dlhšia?": "The line segment $KL$ measures ${@0}\\,\\text{cm}$, the line segment $MN$ measures ${@1}\\,\\text{cm}$. How many centimetres longer is the line segment $KL$?",
