  "Keď niečo pribudne, sčítavame.": "When something is added, we add.",
  "{@0} {@1} {@2} {@3}. Kamarátom {@4} {@5} {@6}. Koľko {@7} {@8} zostalo?": "{@0} {@1} {@2} {@3} and {@4} {@5} {@6} to friends. How many {@7} are left for {@8}?",
