  "Vydeľ so zvyškom: ${@0} : {@1}$. Napíš podiel a zvyšok oddelené bodkočiarkou (napr. 4; 1).": "Divide with a remainder: ${@0} : {@1}$. Write the quotient and the remainder separated by a semicolon (e.g. 4; 1).",
