  "Každý podá ruku {@0} ostatným: ${@1}\\cdot {@2} = {@3}$. Každé podanie sme tak započítali dvakrát, preto ${@4} : 2 = {@5}$.": "Everyone shakes hands with the {@0} others: ${@1}\\cdot {@2} = {@3}$. That way we counted each handshake twice, so ${@4} : 2 = {@5}$.",
