  "{@0} a {@1} si rozdelia {@2} € v pomere ${@3} : {@4}$. Koľko eur dostane {@5} a koľko {@6}? Zapíš v poradí {@7}; {@8}.": "{@0} and {@1} share {@2} € in the ratio ${@3} : {@4}$. How many euros does {@5} get and how many does {@6} get? Write them in the order {@7}; {@8}.",
  "{@0} {@1} {@2} spolu {@3} €. Koľko eur zaplatíme za {@4} {@5}?": "{@0} {@1} {@2} {@3} € altogether. How many euros will we pay for {@4} {@5}?",
  "{@0} {@1} {@2} €. Cena sa znížila o {@3} %. Koľko eur stojí teraz?": "{@0} {@1} {@2} €. The price went down by {@3} %. How many euros does it cost now?",
  "{@0} {@1} {@2} €. Cena sa zvýšila o {@3} %. Koľko eur stojí teraz?": "{@0} {@1} {@2} €. The price went up by {@3} %. How many euros does it cost now?",
  "{@0} € je {@1} % pôvodnej ceny. 1 %: ${@2} : {@3} = {@4}$ €. Pôvodná cena (100 %): ${@5}\\cdot 100 = {@6}$ €.": "{@0} € is {@1} % of the original price. 1 %: ${@2} : {@3} = {@4}$ €. Original price (100 %): ${@5}\\cdot 100 = {@6}$ €.",
  "Úrok je {@0} % z vkladu: ${@1} : 100\\cdot {@2} = {@3}$ €.": "The interest is {@0} % of the deposit: ${@1} : 100\\cdot {@2} = {@3}$ €.",
  "Úrok za rok vypočítaš ako p % z vloženej sumy.": "Work out the interest for a year as p % of the amount deposited.",
  "Časti kružnice a kruhu: stred, polomer, priemer, tetiva a dotyčnica": "Parts of a circle and a disc: centre, radius, diameter, chord and tangent",
  "Čísla nie sú rovnaké. Preveď ich na desatinné čísla a porovnaj.": "The numbers are not equal. Convert them to decimals and compare.",
  "Čísla sa rovnajú.": "The numbers are equal.",
  "Číslice sa môžu opakovať, preto máš na každé miesto všetkých {@0} číslic.": "The digits can repeat, so you have all {@0} digits for each place.",
