  "{@0} Správna možnosť: <strong>{@1}</strong>.": "{@0} The correct option: <strong>{@1}</strong>.",
  "{@0} o ${@1}\\,\\%$ znamená, že nová cena je ${@2}\\,\\%$ pôvodnej.": "{@0} of ${@1}\\,\\%$ means that the new price is ${@2}\\,\\%$ of the original.",
  "{@0} prácu za {@1} {@2}. Za koľko dní by rovnakú prácu {@3}?": "{@0} the job in {@1} {@2}. In how many days would {@3} the same job?",
  "{@0} robotníci by dokončili": "{@0} workers would finish",
  "{@0} robotníkov by dokončilo": "{@0} workers would finish",
  "{@0} {@1} nad osou $x$": "{@0} {@1} above the $x$-axis",
  "{@0} {@1} pod osou $x$": "{@0} {@1} below the $x$-axis",
  "{@0} {@1} podstavy a hlavný vrchol: ${@2} + 1 = {@3}$.": "{@0} {@1} of the base and the apex: ${@2} + 1 = {@3}$.",
  "{@0} {@1} podstavy a {@2} {@3}: $2\\cdot {@4} = {@5}$.": "{@0} {@1} of the base and {@2} {@3}: $2\\cdot {@4} = {@5}$.",
  "{@0} {@1} vpravo od osi $y$": "{@0} {@1} to the right of the $y$-axis",
  "{@0} {@1} vľavo od osi $y$": "{@0} {@1} to the left of the $y$-axis",
  "{@0} {@1} {@2} €. Koľko eur stojí {@3} takých zošitov?": "{@0} {@1} {@2} €. How many euros do {@3} such exercise books cost?",
  "{@0} € je cena za {@1} {@2}, nie za jeden. Najprv zisti cenu jedného zošita.": "{@0} € is the price of {@1} {@2}, not of one. First find the price of one exercise book.",
  "{@0}$S = 2\\pi r^2 + 2\\pi r v = 2\\pi r(r + v) \\approx 2\\cdot 3{,}14\\cdot {@1}\\cdot {@2} = {@3}\\,\\text{cm}^2$.": "{@0}$S = 2\\pi r^2 + 2\\pi r v = 2\\pi r(r + v) \\approx 2\\cdot 3.14\\cdot {@1}\\cdot {@2} = {@3}\\,\\text{cm}^2$.",
  "{@0}$V = \\pi r^2 v \\approx 3{,}14\\cdot {@1}\\cdot {@2} = {@3}\\,\\text{cm}^3$.": "{@0}$V = \\pi r^2 v \\approx 3.14\\cdot {@1}\\cdot {@2} = {@3}\\,\\text{cm}^3$.",
  "{@0}, $x$ sa vyruší: ${@1} = {@2}$, teda $y = {@3}$. Dosadíme do prvej rovnice: ${@4}{@5} = {@6}$, teda $x = {@7}$.": "{@0}, and $x$ cancels out: ${@1} = {@2}$, so $y = {@3}$. We substitute into the first equation: ${@4}{@5} = {@6}$, so $x = {@7}$.",
  "{@0}. Neznáma $x$ sa vyruší a ostane rovnica tvaru $\\square\\, y = {@1}$. Aký koeficient je pri $y$?": "{@0}. The unknown $x$ cancels out and we are left with an equation of the form $\\square\\, y = {@1}$. What is the coefficient of $y$?",
  "{@0}: ${@1}$.": "{@0}: ${@1}$.",
  "· <span class=\"c-ok\">s osou x: [{@0}; 0]</span>": "· <span class=\"c-ok\">meets the x-axis at [{@0}; 0]</span>",
  "· priamka je rovnobežná s osou x": "· the line is parallel to the x-axis",
  "Čitateľ je celý výraz: pri násobení ho daj do zátvorky a vynásob oba jeho členy, aj samotné číslo.": "The numerator is the whole expression: when multiplying, put it in a bracket and multiply both of its terms, including the number on its own.",
  "Čísla sa nerovnajú, trojuholník nie je pravouhlý.": "The numbers are not equal, so the triangle is not right-angled.",
  "Čísla sa rovnajú, trojuholník je pravouhlý.": "The numbers are equal, so the triangle is right-angled.",
  "Číslice sa nesmú opakovať, preto na každé ďalšie miesto ostáva o jednu číslicu menej.": "Digits must not repeat, so for each next place there is one digit fewer left.",
  "Číslo $3{,}14$ je len približná hodnota $\\pi$. Samotné $\\pi$ sa zlomkom zapísať nedá.": "The number $3.14$ is only an approximate value of $\\pi$. $\\pi$ itself cannot be written as a fraction.",
  "Číslo $\\pi$ má nekonečný neperiodický desatinný rozvoj.": "The number $\\pi$ has an infinite non-recurring decimal expansion.",
  "Číslo $k$ určuje sklon priamky. Priesečník s osou $y$ dostaneš dosadením $x = 0$.": "The number $k$ gives the steepness of the line. You get the intersection with the $y$-axis by substituting $x = 0$.",
  "Číslo $q$ udáva priesečník s osou $y$. Pre priesečník s osou $x$ polož $y = 0$ a vyrieš rovnicu.": "The number $q$ gives the intersection with the $y$-axis. For the intersection with the $x$-axis, put $y = 0$ and solve the equation.",
  "Číslo {@0} nie je druhou mocninou celého ani racionálneho čísla, odmocnina z neho sa nedá zapísať zlomkom.": "The number {@0} is not the square of an integer or of a rational number; its square root cannot be written as a fraction.",
  "Číslo {@0} nie je druhou mocninou celého čísla, preto je $\\sqrt{{@1}}$ iracionálne.": "The number {@0} is not the square of an integer, so $\\sqrt{{@1}}$ is irrational.",
  "Číslo {@0} nie je základ, ale percentová časť – je to len ${@1}\\,\\%$ hľadaného čísla. Zisti, koľko je 1 %.": "The number {@0} is not the base but the percentage amount – it is only ${@1}\\,\\%$ of the number you are looking for. Find out how much 1 % is.",
  "červené": "red",
