  "{@0} Asymptoty sú $x = {@1}$ a $y = {@2}$, stred hyperboly je $S[{@3}; {@4}]$. Navyše $D(f) = {@5}\\setminus\\{{@6}\\}$ a $H(f) = {@7}\\setminus\\{{@8}\\}$.": "{@0} The asymptotes are $x = {@1}$ and $y = {@2}$, the centre of the hyperbola is $S[{@3}; {@4}]$. Moreover $D(f) = {@5}\\setminus\\{{@6}\\}$ and $H(f) = {@7}\\setminus\\{{@8}\\}$.",
  "{@0} Funkcia je {@1}. Odpoveď: ${@2}$.": "{@0} The function is {@1}. Answer: ${@2}$.",
  "{@0} Funkcia má {@1} ${@2}$, preto $H(f) = {@3}$.": "{@0} The function has the {@1} ${@2}$, so $H(f) = {@3}$.",
  "{@0} Jeho odvesny majú dĺžky $a = {@1}$ cm a $b = {@2}$ cm. Vypočítaj výšku na preponu v cm.": "{@0} Its legs have lengths $a = {@1}$ cm and $b = {@2}$ cm. Calculate the altitude to the hypotenuse in cm.",
  "{@0} Koľko riešení má rovnica $f(x) = {@1}$? {@2}": "{@0} How many solutions does the equation $f(x) = {@1}$ have? {@2}",
  "{@0} Prepona má dĺžku $c = {@1}$ cm a úsek prepony pri strane $a$ je $c_a = {@2}$ cm. Vypočítaj dĺžku odvesny $a$ v cm.": "{@0} The hypotenuse has length $c = {@1}$ cm and the segment of the hypotenuse adjacent to side $a$ is $c_a = {@2}$ cm. Calculate the length of the leg $a$ in cm.",
  "{@0} Urči $f({@1})$. {@2}": "{@0} Find $f({@1})$. {@2}",
  "{@0} Urči obor hodnôt $H(f)$. {@1}": "{@0} Find the range $H(f)$. {@1}",
  "{@0} Výška na preponu ju delí na úseky $c_a = {@1}$ cm a $c_b = {@2}$ cm. Vypočítaj výšku $v$ v cm.": "{@0} The altitude to the hypotenuse divides it into segments $c_a = {@1}$ cm and $c_b = {@2}$ cm. Calculate the altitude $v$ in cm.",
  "{@0} Výška na preponu má dĺžku $v = {@1}$ cm a úsek prepony $c_a = {@2}$ cm. Vypočítaj úsek $c_b$ v cm.": "{@0} The altitude to the hypotenuse has length $v = {@1}$ cm and the segment of the hypotenuse is $c_a = {@2}$ cm. Calculate the segment $c_b$ in cm.",
  "{@0} a {@1}": "{@0} and {@1}",
  "{@0} hranol": "{@0} prism",
  "{@0} ihlan": "{@0} pyramid",
  "{@0} má dve podstavy ({@1}): $2\\cdot {@2} = {@3}$ vrcholov; ${@4}$ hrán v každej podstave a ${@5}$ bočných hrán, spolu ${@6}$ hrán; ${@7}$ bočných stien a $2$ podstavy, spolu ${@8}$ stien. Kontrola Eulerovým vzťahom: ${@9} - {@10} + {@11} = 2$.": "{@0} has two bases ({@1}): $2\\cdot {@2} = {@3}$ vertices; ${@4}$ edges in each base and ${@5}$ lateral edges, ${@6}$ edges in total; ${@7}$ lateral faces and $2$ bases, ${@8}$ faces in total. Check with Euler's formula: ${@9} - {@10} + {@11} = 2$.",
  "{@0} má podstavu ({@1}) a hlavný vrchol: ${@2} + 1 = {@3}$ vrcholov; ${@4}$ podstavných a ${@5}$ bočných hrán, spolu ${@6}$ hrán; ${@7}$ bočných stien a podstavu, spolu ${@8}$ stien. Kontrola Eulerovým vzťahom: ${@9} - {@10} + {@11} = 2$.": "{@0} has a base ({@1}) and an apex: ${@2} + 1 = {@3}$ vertices; ${@4}$ base edges and ${@5}$ lateral edges, ${@6}$ edges in total; ${@7}$ lateral faces and the base, ${@8}$ faces in total. Check with Euler's formula: ${@9} - {@10} + {@11} = 2$.",
  "{@0}, teda ${@1}^{{@2}} = {@3}^{{@4}}$. Porovnáme exponenty: ${@5} = {@6}$, odtiaľ {@7}.": "{@0}, so ${@1}^{{@2}} = {@3}^{{@4}}$. We compare the exponents: ${@5} = {@6}$, hence {@7}.",
  "{@0}Posun o ${@1}$ {@2} znamená nahradiť $x$ výrazom ${@3}$, posun {@4} znamená pripočítať ${@5}$. Dostaneme ${@6}$.": "{@0}A shift by ${@1}$ {@2} means replacing $x$ with ${@3}$, a shift {@4} means adding ${@5}$. We get ${@6}$.",
  "Čitateľ smie byť nulový (zlomok je potom rovný nule). Podmienky určuje iba menovateľ.": "The numerator may be zero (the fraction is then equal to zero). Only the denominator determines the conditions.",
  "Čitateľ upravíme: ${@0} = {@1}({@2}){@3}$, teda $f(x) = {@4}$.": "We rewrite the numerator: ${@0} = {@1}({@2}){@3}$, so $f(x) = {@4}$.",
  "Čitateľ zapíš ako násobok menovateľa plus zvyšok, aby si dostal tvar $\\frac{k}{x - m} + n$.": "Write the numerator as a multiple of the denominator plus a remainder to get the form $\\frac{k}{x - m} + n$.",
  "Člen ${@0}$ je nepárna mocnina – dosadením $-x$ zmení znamienko, kým ostatné členy nie. Porovnaj $f(1)$ a $f(-1)$.": "The term ${@0}$ is an odd power – substituting $-x$ changes its sign, while the other terms do not change. Compare $f(1)$ and $f(-1)$.",
  "Člen s $x^2$ a konštanta pri dosadení $-x$ znamienko nezmenia, preto $f(-x)\\neq -f(x)$. Porovnaj $f(1)$ a $f(-1)$.": "The term with $x^2$ and the constant do not change sign when you substitute $-x$, so $f(-x)\\neq -f(x)$. Compare $f(1)$ and $f(-1)$.",
  "Číslo $n$ nie je zvyšok po delení, ale podiel vedúcich koeficientov čitateľa a menovateľa (vodorovná asymptota).": "The number $n$ is not the remainder after division but the quotient of the leading coefficients of the numerator and the denominator (horizontal asymptote).",
  "Číslo ${@0}$ je argument zlúčeného logaritmu – ešte treba vypočítať jeho logaritmus.": "The number ${@0}$ is the argument of the combined logarithm – you still have to calculate its logarithm.",
  "Číslo ${@0}$ zapíšeme ako ${@1}^{{@2}}$, teda $y = {@3}$.": "We write the number ${@0}$ as ${@1}^{{@2}}$, so $y = {@3}$.",
  "Číslo odčítané od $x$ v argumente posúva graf vodorovne (opačne, než naznačuje znamienko), číslo pripočítané k funkcii zvislo.": "A number subtracted from $x$ in the argument shifts the graph horizontally (opposite to what the sign suggests), a number added to the function shifts it vertically.",
  "Číslu ${@0}$ na osi $x$ zodpovedá bod grafu $[{@1}; {@2}]$, teda $f({@3}) = {@4}$.": "The number ${@0}$ on the $x$-axis corresponds to the point of the graph $[{@1}; {@2}]$, so $f({@3}) = {@4}$.",
  "Šesťboký hranol": "Hexagonal prism",
  "Šesťboký ihlan": "Hexagonal pyramid",
  "Šesťuholník sa skladá zo šiestich rovnostranných trojuholníkov so stranou ${@0}$: $S = 6\\cdot\\frac{\\sqrt3}{4}\\cdot {@1} = {@2}\\sqrt3\\approx {@3}$ cm².": "The hexagon consists of six equilateral triangles with side ${@0}$: $S = 6\\cdot\\frac{\\sqrt3}{4}\\cdot {@1} = {@2}\\sqrt3\\approx {@3}$ cm².",
