  "$S\\left[\\frac{{@0} + {@1}}{2}; \\frac{{@2} + {@3}}{2}\\right] = S[{@4}; {@5}]$.": "$S\\left[\\frac{{@0} + {@1}}{2}; \\frac{{@2} + {@3}}{2}\\right] = S[{@4}; {@5}]$.",
  "$\\alpha = {@0}^\\circ = {@1}$, $l = r\\cdot\\alpha = {@2}\\cdot {@3} \\approx {@4}$ cm.": "$\\alpha = {@0}^\\circ = {@1}$, $l = r\\cdot\\alpha = {@2}\\cdot {@3} \\approx {@4}$ cm.",
  "$\\binom{32}{2} - \\binom{28}{2} = {@0} - {@1} = {@2}$ (od všetkých odčítame dvojice bez esa)": "$\\binom{32}{2} - \\binom{28}{2} = {@0} - {@1} = {@2}$ (from all pairs we subtract the pairs without an ace)",
  "$\\binom{n}{k} = \\frac{n\\cdot(n-1)\\cdot\\ldots\\cdot(n-k+1)}{k!}$; ak je $k$ blízko $n$, použi $\\binom{n}{k} = \\binom{n}{n-k}$.": "$\\binom{n}{k} = \\frac{n\\cdot(n-1)\\cdot\\ldots\\cdot(n-k+1)}{k!}$; if $k$ is close to $n$, use $\\binom{n}{k} = \\binom{n}{n-k}$.",
  "$\\cos 2x + 1 = 2\\cos^2 x$, teda $\\frac{2\\cos^2 x}{2\\cos x} = \\cos x$.": "$\\cos 2x + 1 = 2\\cos^2 x$, so $\\frac{2\\cos^2 x}{2\\cos x} = \\cos x$.",
  "$\\cos 2x$ nie je $2\\cos x$ – použi $\\cos 2x = \\cos^2 x - \\sin^2 x$.": "$\\cos 2x$ is not $2\\cos x$ – use $\\cos 2x = \\cos^2 x - \\sin^2 x$.",
