  "Vypočítaj argument ${@0}\\cdot {@1}$. Zadaj ho ako násobok $\\pi$ (napr. 5/6).": "Calculate the argument ${@0}\\cdot {@1}$. Enter it as a multiple of $\\pi$ (e.g. 5/6).",
