  "{@0}Uhol ${@1}^\\circ$ leží medzi ${@2}^\\circ$ a ${@3}^\\circ$, teda v {@4} kvadrante.": "{@0}The angle ${@1}^\\circ$ lies between ${@2}^\\circ$ and ${@3}^\\circ$, i.e. in quadrant {@4}.",
  "{@0}Uhol ${@1}^\\circ$ leží v {@2} kvadrante, kde je {@3} kladný. Hodnota je kladná.": "{@0}The angle ${@1}^\\circ$ lies in quadrant {@2}, where {@3} is positive. The value is positive.",
  "{@0}Uhol ${@1}^\\circ$ leží v {@2} kvadrante, kde je {@3} záporný. Hodnota je záporná.": "{@0}The angle ${@1}^\\circ$ lies in quadrant {@2}, where {@3} is negative. The value is negative.",
  "{@0}Uhol ${@1}^\\circ$ leží v {@2} kvadrante, príslušný ostrý uhol je ${@3}^\\circ$ a {@4} je tu {@5}. Preto ${@6}\\,{@7} = {@8}{@9}\\,{@10}^\\circ = {@11}$.": "{@0}The angle ${@1}^\\circ$ lies in quadrant {@2}, the corresponding acute angle is ${@3}^\\circ$ and {@4} is {@5} here. Therefore ${@6}\\,{@7} = {@8}{@9}\\,{@10}^\\circ = {@11}$.",
