  "platí $A^{T}=-A$, teda matica je antisymetrická": "$A^{T}=-A$ holds, so the matrix is skew-symmetric",
  "platí $A^{T}=A$, teda matica je symetrická": "$A^{T}=A$ holds, so the matrix is symmetric",
