  "$\\frac{\\partial Q}{\\partial x}-\\frac{\\partial P}{\\partial y}={@0}-{@1}={@2}$ (členy ${@3}$ a ${@4}$ k rozdielu neprispejú). Podľa Greenovej vety je integrál rovný ${@5}\\cdot S(D)={@6}\\cdot {@7}={@8}${@9}.": "$\\frac{\\partial Q}{\\partial x}-\\frac{\\partial P}{\\partial y}={@0}-{@1}={@2}$ (the terms ${@3}$ and ${@4}$ do not contribute to the difference). By Green's theorem the integral equals ${@5}\\cdot S(D)={@6}\\cdot {@7}={@8}${@9}.",
