  "$\\sin u=u-\\frac{u^3}{3!}+\\frac{u^5}{5!}-\\cdots$ s $u={@0}$: koeficient pri $x^{{@1}}$ je ${@2}\\frac{{@3}^{{@4}}}{{@5}!}$": "$\\sin u=u-\\frac{u^3}{3!}+\\frac{u^5}{5!}-\\cdots$ with $u={@0}$: the coefficient of $x^{{@1}}$ is ${@2}\\frac{{@3}^{{@4}}}{{@5}!}$",
