  "$|a_n|=\\frac{n}{n+1}\\to 1$, nie je splnená nutná podmienka konvergencie.": "$|a_n|=\\frac{n}{n+1}\\to 1$, the necessary condition for convergence is not satisfied.",
  "$|z|=\\sqrt{(\\operatorname{Re} z)^2+(\\operatorname{Im} z)^2}=\\sqrt{{@0}^2+{@1}^2}=\\sqrt{{@2}}={@3}$.": "$|z|=\\sqrt{(\\operatorname{Re} z)^2+(\\operatorname{Im} z)^2}=\\sqrt{{@0}^2+{@1}^2}=\\sqrt{{@2}}={@3}$.",
  "$|z|=\\sqrt{1+3}=2$ a $\\arg z={@0}^\\circ$. Podľa Moivreovej vety $z^{{@1}}=2^{{@2}}\\bigl(\\cos({@3}^\\circ)+\\mathrm{i}\\sin({@4}^\\circ)\\bigr)={@5}\\cdot({@6})={@7}$, imaginárna časť je $0$. Odpoveď: ${@8};\\ 0$.": "$|z|=\\sqrt{1+3}=2$ and $\\arg z={@0}^\\circ$. By de Moivre's theorem $z^{{@1}}=2^{{@2}}\\bigl(\\cos({@3}^\\circ)+\\mathrm{i}\\sin({@4}^\\circ)\\bigr)={@5}\\cdot({@6})={@7}$, the imaginary part is $0$. Answer: ${@8};\\ 0$.",
  "$|z|=\\sqrt{2}$ a $\\arg z={@0}^\\circ$, teda $z=\\sqrt{2}\\,\\bigl(\\cos({@1}^\\circ)+\\mathrm{i}\\sin({@2}^\\circ)\\bigr)$. Podľa Moivreovej vety $z^{{@3}}=(\\sqrt{2})^{{@4}}\\bigl(\\cos({@5}^\\circ)+\\mathrm{i}\\sin({@6}^\\circ)\\bigr)$, kde $(\\sqrt{2})^{{@7}}={@8}$ a uhol ${@9}^\\circ$ má rovnakú polohu ako ${@10}^\\circ$. Výsledok: $z^{{@11}}={@12}$, odpoveď ${@13};\\ {@14}$.": "$|z|=\\sqrt{2}$ and $\\arg z={@0}^\\circ$, so $z=\\sqrt{2}\\,\\bigl(\\cos({@1}^\\circ)+\\mathrm{i}\\sin({@2}^\\circ)\\bigr)$. By de Moivre's theorem $z^{{@3}}=(\\sqrt{2})^{{@4}}\\bigl(\\cos({@5}^\\circ)+\\mathrm{i}\\sin({@6}^\\circ)\\bigr)$, where $(\\sqrt{2})^{{@7}}={@8}$ and the angle ${@9}^\\circ$ has the same position as ${@10}^\\circ$. Result: $z^{{@11}}={@12}$, answer ${@13};\\ {@14}$.",
  "$|z|=\\sqrt{{@0}^2+{@1}^2}=\\sqrt{{@2}}\\approx {@3}$.": "$|z|=\\sqrt{{@0}^2+{@1}^2}=\\sqrt{{@2}}\\approx {@3}$.",
  "(Leibnizovo kritérium)": "(Leibniz test)",
  "(absolútne)": "(absolutely)",
  "(bez $\\pi$)": "(without $\\pi$)",
  "(harmonický rad)": "(harmonic series)",
  "(členy nejdú k nule)": "(the terms do not tend to zero)",
  ", koeficient pri $\\pi$ je ${@0}$": ", the coefficient of $\\pi$ is ${@0}$",
  "<span class=\"c-accent\">3x + 4y = {@0}</span> · <span class=\"c-ok\">x² + y² = 25</span> · {@1}": "<span class=\"c-accent\">3x + 4y = {@0}</span> · <span class=\"c-ok\">x² + y² = 25</span> · {@1}",
  "<span class=\"c-accent\">T<sub>{@0}</sub>(x) = {@1}</span> · chyba v bode x = π: |sin π − T<sub>{@2}</sub>(π)| = {@3}": "<span class=\"c-accent\">T<sub>{@0}</sub>(x) = {@1}</span> · error at x = π: |sin π − T<sub>{@2}</sub>(π)| = {@3}",
  "<span class=\"c-accent\">s<sub>{@0}</sub> = {@1}</span> · ln 2 ≈ {@2} · skutočná chyba {@3} ≤ a<sub>{@4}</sub> = 1/{@5} ≈ {@6}": "<span class=\"c-accent\">s<sub>{@0}</sub> = {@1}</span> · ln 2 ≈ {@2} · actual error {@3} ≤ a<sub>{@4}</sub> = 1/{@5} ≈ {@6}",
  "<span class=\"c-accent\">vrstevnica x²/4 + y² = {@0}</span> · elipsa s poloosami a = 2√c ≈ {@1} a b = √c ≈ {@2}": "<span class=\"c-accent\">level curve x²/4 + y² = {@0}</span> · an ellipse with semi-axes a = 2√c ≈ {@1} and b = √c ≈ {@2}",
  "<span class=\"c-accent\">z ≈ {@0} {@1} {@2}i</span> = {@3}·(cos {@4}° + i sin {@5}°) ·": "<span class=\"c-accent\">z ≈ {@0} {@1} {@2}i</span> = {@3}·(cos {@4}° + i sin {@5}°) ·",
  "A; B": "A; B",
  "A; B; C": "A; B; C",
  "Absolútna hodnota je $2$ a argument je násobok $60^\\circ$; použi Moivreovu vetu.": "The absolute value is $2$ and the argument is a multiple of $60^\\circ$; use de Moivre's theorem.",
  "Absolútna hodnota je $\\sqrt{2}$, nie $2$ – umocňuješ $(\\sqrt{2})^n$, nie $2^n$.": "The absolute value is $\\sqrt{2}$, not $2$ – you are raising $(\\sqrt{2})^n$, not $2^n$.",
  "Absolútna hodnota nie je súčet $|a|+|b|$: je to dĺžka prepony, teda $\\sqrt{a^2+b^2}$.": "The absolute value is not the sum $|a|+|b|$: it is the length of the hypotenuse, i.e. $\\sqrt{a^2+b^2}$.",
  "Absolútna hodnota súčinu je súčinom absolútnych hodnôt, preto $|z^{{@0}}|=|z|^{{@1}}=\\left(\\sqrt{{@2}}\\right)^{{@3}}={@4}^{{@5}}={@6}$. Umocňovať v algebraickom tvare netreba.": "The absolute value of a product is the product of the absolute values, so $|z^{{@0}}|=|z|^{{@1}}=\\left(\\sqrt{{@2}}\\right)^{{@3}}={@4}^{{@5}}={@6}$. There is no need to compute the power in algebraic form.",
  "Absolútna hodnota čísla $a+b\\mathrm{i}$ je vzdialenosť bodu $[a;b]$ od počiatku: $\\sqrt{a^2+b^2}$.": "The absolute value of the number $a+b\\mathrm{i}$ is the distance of the point $[a;b]$ from the origin: $\\sqrt{a^2+b^2}$.",
  "Absolútna konvergencia znamená, že konverguje rad $\\sum|a_n|$. Over ho porovnaním s radom $\\sum\\frac{1}{n^p}$.": "Absolute convergence means that the series $\\sum|a_n|$ converges. Check it by comparison with the series $\\sum\\frac{1}{n^p}$.",
  "Absolútny člen čitateľa nie je $B$: z $A{@0}+B$ vznikne absolútny člen $B{@1}$ – dosaď radšej $x={@2}$.": "The constant term of the numerator is not $B$: $A{@0}+B$ gives the constant term $B{@1}$ – better substitute $x={@2}$.",
  "Ak $a_n\\to 0$, nutná podmienka je splnená – divergenciu z nej teda vyvodiť nemožno.": "If $a_n\\to 0$, the necessary condition is satisfied – so divergence cannot be concluded from it.",
  "Aká dlhá je poloos v smere osi $x$?": "How long is the semi-axis in the direction of the $x$-axis?",
  "Aká je absolútna hodnota jakobiánu $|J|$ transformácie {@0}?": "What is the absolute value of the Jacobian $|J|$ of the transformation {@0}?",
  "Aká je divergencia v bode $A$?": "What is the divergence at the point $A$?",
