  "{@0} Do intervalu $(0^\\circ;90^\\circ)$ patrí {@1} z nich, odpoveď je <strong>{@2}</strong>.": "{@0} {@1} of them lie in the interval $(0^\\circ;90^\\circ)$, the answer is <strong>{@2}</strong>.",
  "{@0} Najmenší kladný z nich je ${@1}^\\circ$.": "{@0} The smallest positive one of them is ${@1}^\\circ$.",
  "{@0}. Determinant sústavy je ${@1}\\cdot{@2}-{@3}^2={@4}\\neq 0$, sústava má jediné riešenie $x={@5}$, $y={@6}$.": "{@0}. The determinant of the system is ${@1}\\cdot{@2}-{@3}^2={@4}\\neq 0$, the system has the unique solution $x={@5}$, $y={@6}$.",
  "{@0}. Jednotkový vektor $\\vec u=\\frac{\\vec v}{|\\vec v|}=\\left({@1},\\,{@2}\\right)$. $\\frac{\\partial f}{\\partial\\vec u}=\\nabla f\\cdot\\vec u=\\dfrac{{@3}\\cdot{@4}+{@5}\\cdot{@6}}{{@7}}={@8}$.": "{@0}. The unit vector is $\\vec u=\\frac{\\vec v}{|\\vec v|}=\\left({@1},\\,{@2}\\right)$. $\\frac{\\partial f}{\\partial\\vec u}=\\nabla f\\cdot\\vec u=\\dfrac{{@3}\\cdot{@4}+{@5}\\cdot{@6}}{{@7}}={@8}$.",
