  "Vypočítaj $E(X)$ aj $E(X^2)=\\int x^2f(x)\\,\\mathrm{d}x$ a použi $D(X)=E(X^2)-(E(X))^2$.": "Compute $E(X)$ and $E(X^2)=\\int x^2f(x)\\,\\mathrm{d}x$ and use $D(X)=E(X^2)-(E(X))^2$.",
