  "Vypočítaj $P(B\\setminus A)$.": "Compute $P(B\\setminus A)$.",
  "Vypočítaj $P(H_{@0})\\,P(A\\mid H_{@1})$ pre zdroj {@2}.": "Compute $P(H_{@0})\\,P(A\\mid H_{@1})$ for source {@2}.",
  "Vypočítaj $P(H_{@0})\\,P(A\\mid H_{@1})$.": "Compute $P(H_{@0})\\,P(A\\mid H_{@1})$.",
  "Vypočítaj $P(H_{@0}\\mid A)$. {@1}": "Compute $P(H_{@0}\\mid A)$. {@1}",
