  "Vypočítaj $P({@0})$. Výsledok zaokrúhli na 6 desatinných miest.": "Compute $P({@0})$. Round the result to 6 decimal places.",
  "Vypočítaj $P({@0})$. {@1}": "Compute $P({@0})$. {@1}",
  "Vypočítaj $P({@0}\\lt X\\le {@1})$.": "Compute $P({@0}\\lt X\\le {@1})$.",
  "Vypočítaj $P({@0}\\lt X\\lt {@1})$. {@2}": "Compute $P({@0}\\lt X\\lt {@1})$. {@2}",
  "Vypočítaj $Q_1$, $Q_3$ a hranice $Q_1-1{,}5\\,IQR$, $Q_3+1{,}5\\,IQR$; spočítaj hodnoty mimo nich.": "Compute $Q_1$, $Q_3$ and the fences $Q_1-1.5\\,IQR$, $Q_3+1.5\\,IQR$; count the values outside them.",
  "Vypočítaj $R^2$. {@0}": "Compute $R^2$. {@0}",
  "Vypočítaj $S_{xx}$.": "Compute $S_{xx}$.",
  "Vypočítaj $S_{xx}=\\sum x_i^2-n\\bar{x}^2$.": "Compute $S_{xx}=\\sum x_i^2-n\\bar{x}^2$.",
  "Vypočítaj $S_{xx}=\\sum(x_i-\\bar{x})^2$.": "Compute $S_{xx}=\\sum(x_i-\\bar{x})^2$.",
  "Vypočítaj $S_{xy}$.": "Compute $S_{xy}$.",
  "Vypočítaj $S_{xy}=\\sum x_iy_i-n\\bar{x}\\bar{y}$.": "Compute $S_{xy}=\\sum x_iy_i-n\\bar{x}\\bar{y}$.",
  "Vypočítaj $S_{xy}=\\sum(x_i-\\bar{x})(y_i-\\bar{y})$.": "Compute $S_{xy}=\\sum(x_i-\\bar{x})(y_i-\\bar{y})$.",
  "Vypočítaj $S_{yy}$.": "Compute $S_{yy}$.",
  "Vypočítaj $T=\\frac{\\bar{x}-\\mu_0}{s}\\sqrt{n}$ a porovnaj s kritickou hodnotou podľa tvaru alternatívy.": "Compute $T=\\frac{\\bar{x}-\\mu_0}{s}\\sqrt{n}$ and compare it with the critical value according to the form of the alternative.",
  "Vypočítaj $Z$. {@0}": "Compute $Z$. {@0}",
  "Vypočítaj $\\bar{x}$ a $\\bar{y}$. Zadaj ich v tvare „x̄; ȳ“.": "Compute $\\bar{x}$ and $\\bar{y}$. Enter them in the form \"x̄; ȳ\".",
  "Vypočítaj $\\chi^2$. {@0}": "Compute $\\chi^2$. {@0}",
  "Vypočítaj $\\chi^2=\\sum\\frac{(N_i-np_i)^2}{np_i}$ a porovnaj ho s kvantilom $\\chi^2_{0{,}95}(k-1)$.": "Compute $\\chi^2=\\sum\\frac{(N_i-np_i)^2}{np_i}$ and compare it with the quantile $\\chi^2_{0.95}(k-1)$.",
  "Vypočítaj $\\hat{y}({@0})$.": "Compute $\\hat{y}({@0})$.",
  "Vypočítaj $\\left(\\frac{z\\sigma}{\\Delta}\\right)^2$ (na 2 desatinné miesta).": "Compute $\\left(\\frac{z\\sigma}{\\Delta}\\right)^2$ (to 2 decimal places).",
  "Vypočítaj $\\operatorname{cov}(X, Y)$.": "Compute $\\operatorname{cov}(X, Y)$.",
  "Vypočítaj $\\operatorname{cov}(X, Y)$. {@0}": "Compute $\\operatorname{cov}(X, Y)$. {@0}",
  "Vypočítaj $\\rho(X, Y)$. {@0}": "Compute $\\rho(X, Y)$. {@0}",
  "Vypočítaj $\\sqrt{p_0(1-p_0)/n}$.": "Compute $\\sqrt{p_0(1-p_0)/n}$.",
  "Vypočítaj $\\sum x_i^2-n\\bar{x}^2$.": "Compute $\\sum x_i^2-n\\bar{x}^2$.",
