  "rád 6": "order 6",
  "Čísla sú rovnaké, $\\operatorname{NSD}={@0}$.": "The numbers are equal, $\\gcd={@0}$.",
  "Číslo ${@0}$ je koreň, teda $(x-{@1})$ delí $f$ a polynóm je <strong>reducibilný</strong>.": "The number ${@0}$ is a root, so $(x-{@1})$ divides $f$ and the polynomial is <strong>reducible</strong>.",
  "Číslo ${@0}$ je prvočíslo, preto je každý nenulový zvyšok nesúdeliteľný s ${@1}$ a má inverzný prvok.": "The number ${@0}$ is a prime, so every nonzero residue is coprime to ${@1}$ and has an inverse element.",
  "Číslo ${@0}$ je prvočíslo, preto súčin nenulových zvyškov je nenulový a každý nenulový zvyšok je nesúdeliteľný s ${@1}$, má teda inverzný prvok.": "The number ${@0}$ is a prime, so the product of nonzero residues is nonzero and every nonzero residue is coprime to ${@1}$, so it has an inverse element.",
  "Číslo ${@0}$ nedelí ${@1}$, ale ľavá strana ${@2}x-{@3}$ by musela byť deliteľná ${@4}$, teda aj ${@5}$ – riešenie neexistuje, odpoveď je $0$.": "The number ${@0}$ does not divide ${@1}$, but the left-hand side ${@2}x-{@3}$ would have to be divisible by ${@4}$, hence also by ${@5}$ – there is no solution, the answer is $0$.",
  "Číslo ${@0}$ neleží v $\\mathbb{Q}({@1})$, takže pridá ďalší stupeň $2$; stupne sa násobia.": "The number ${@0}$ does not lie in $\\mathbb{Q}({@1})$, so it adds another degree $2$; the degrees multiply.",
  "Číslo je koreňom polynómu $x^{{@0}}-{@1}$, ktorý je podľa Eisensteinovho kritéria (prvočíslo ${@2}$) ireducibilný nad $\\mathbb{Q}$. Je to teda minimálny polynóm a stupeň rozšírenia je ${@3}$.": "The number is a root of the polynomial $x^{{@0}}-{@1}$, which is irreducible over $\\mathbb{Q}$ by Eisenstein's criterion (prime ${@2}$). So it is the minimal polynomial and the degree of the extension is ${@3}$.",
  "Šifrovanie v RSA je umocnenie $m^{e}$, nie násobenie $m\\cdot e$.": "Encryption in RSA is the power $m^{e}$, not the product $m\\cdot e$.",
  "Žiadna hodnota nie je nulová, polynóm nemá v $\\mathbb{Z}_{{@0}}$ koreň.": "No value is zero, so the polynomial has no root in $\\mathbb{Z}_{{@0}}$.",
  "ℤ<sub>{@0}</sub>: neutrálny prvok 0 · <span class=\"c-accent\">inverzné prvky: {@1}</span>": "ℤ<sub>{@0}</sub>: identity element 0 · <span class=\"c-accent\">inverse elements: {@1}</span>",
